WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.700
Good morning, everyone!

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Cinderella? Cinderella! Cinderella!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.450
It's like it's her world and we're just living in

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:06.600
it.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.200
Cinderella!

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.500
I'm here to make all your dreams come true

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.276
after the way you've been treated by your evil

00:00:14.276 --> 00:00:15.000
stepsisters.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.500
Evil stepsister?

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.100
You deserve to know the real story.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.500
Looks like we have a ball to crash.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.800
Let's go!

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.100
No!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.700
I'm gonna say it, tonight was weird.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.500
Now the story's broken!

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.140
There is one way and one way only to fix this

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:38.400
mess.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.200
The prince has gotta put this slipper on your foot

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.800
before midnight or we're all toast.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.200
Especially you, my dear.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.800
You'll become a full frog forever.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.800
Look at us!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.400
Our first girls' trip.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.800
We appear to be producing condensation?

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.300
Oh, that's called sweat, babe.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.700
You're like the rest of us now.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.139
Not all of us had a magical personal assistant

00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:01.200
pulling the strings.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.800
What is all this?

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.300
God!

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.300
Why is everyone trying to kill us today?

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.500
Stay safe out there, Lilith.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.100
And I want to say, Samantha?

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.300
That's not a name. It's Cinderella.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.800
To be fair, Cinderella isn't a name either.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.500
You were supposed to help me!

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.000
It's not too late.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:35.800
This is bad.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.500
We're in a race against time.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.300
We gotta move.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.200
This can't go wrong.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.400
I can't lose her.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.400
I'm scared.

